final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_vri60")
province = 70
blurb = "Depicts a scene from the fictionalized biography of Minamoto no Yoshitsune, a famous 12th-century samurai general. In this scene, the young Yoshitsune (still using his birth name, Ushiwakamaru) finds a military treatise by Kiichi Hōgen (literally \"first demon priest\"), a legendary warrior monk, and gains supernatural power from it.

Yoshitsune's life was defined by a dramatic rise to military glory and a tragic end. After surviving the Heiji Rebellion, he was raised in a temple then left to launch a war campaign before being betrayed and forced to commit suicide by his brother, Minamoto no Yoritomo, the first shōgun of the Kamakura shogunate."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
